                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (c_1\oplus c_2,i_1,i_2)
            is a coproduct tuple, and
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
